{
 "format": "pcbpro",
 "version": 1,
 "name": "Tweed Champ 5W SE",
 "author": "",
 "revision": "A",
 "notes": "Tweed Champ-style 5 W single-ended amp.\nPower transformer 325-0-325 VAC / 5 V 2 A / 6.3 V 1 A; output transformer 5k : 8 ohm.\nMains fuse, power switch and the transformer primary are wired on the chassis, not on this board.\nB+1 ~360 V (filter caps and the 5 V winding sit at this voltage!), B+2 ~300 V screen, B+3 ~250 V preamp. The 220k bleeder discharges the caps in about 20 s - always measure before touching.\nThe 6V6 plate runs above its 315 V data-sheet rating, as in the original Champ.",
 "board": {
  "outline": [
